Peter,

I&rsquo;ve been pouring my all into this race since day one.

We&rsquo;ve racked up tens of thousands of miles on the campaign car meeting voters across the district, got ads up on the air, fended off absurd attacks from my radical opponent, and we&rsquo;re continuing to fight for every inch in this race.

