I know many of you have already stepped up to support my campaign, and for that I am so grateful.

But if you are able to give again today, it would make an incredible impact.

The truth is, I know pulling off a victory in IL-17 will be hard&mdash;but it is possible.

As I&rsquo;ve talked with voters across the district, I&rsquo;ve been able to hear from them what&rsquo;s on their mind.

They&rsquo;re worried about the surging crime in our cities. They&rsquo;re being burdened by the surging costs. They&rsquo;re ready for a leader who shows up, listens, and get things done for them.

https://click.email.judgejoeforcongress.com/?qs=962db0ca9d946aa710ddf66e3604980f85e11a27c5da55819f102ae7a23f76b3a91de863fc6bec85b0f6f28c2fe218a16189949d260df3f1

I stepped down from the bench to run for Congress because I know IL-17 deserves better. I&rsquo;m doing everything I can to win this race so we can get back to work for the great people of our district.

But with time running out and Democrats pouring funds into this race, I could use your help.

